  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (amending Penal Code 46.06(a)(2)(B)): {+to a person younger than 21 years of age a +} {+semiautomatic rifle that is capable of accepting a detachable +} {+magazine and that has a caliber greater than .22+};\nSec. 1 (adding Penal Code 46.06(c-1)(1)): {+the semiautomatic rifle is transferred to a +} {+recipient who:+} {+(A)  is a peace officer; or+} {+(B)+} {+is currently serving in or has been honorably +} {+discharged from the United States armed forces; or+}\nSec. 1 (amending Penal Code 46.06(d)(2)): an offense under Subsection {+(a)(2)(B) or+} (a)(7) is a state jail felony.",
